  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="6.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIEm">III Em</ref> 6.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Et si vestigium illud de terra illa non possit educi, quaeratur ubicunque suspectum fuerit ac dubium.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if the track cannot be followed beyond the bounds of that estate, search shall be made wherever suspicion or doubt attaches.</ab>
      </div>
